                        Sidestep
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Syntax: sidestep

During combat, spend one Opportunity and 15 SP to gain a large dodge
bonus for about two combat rounds. Sidestep cannot be stacked or
refreshed while active and has a twelve-second reuse time.

The Runner Method extends Sidestep by one heartbeat. The Opportunist
Method returns its Opportunity when the effect ends if no attack landed
on the Thief while it was active.
